 and top class after salesport.", "Our Motto :", "1. Quality", "Supply our customers with quality products and qualified personnel.", "2. Trust", "Do our job proffesionally, responsive technical support, and competitive price.", "Commitment :", "We believed that long term and good relation with customer is key factor to achieve success.", "Customer satisfaction is our first priority. Every personnel in company is well trained in their field and committed in providing only the best service to you.", "What is customer’s needs is our consideration in giving service to customers.", "That’s why we always offering innovation, idea and solution base on cost effectiveness."], "__typename": "Description"}, "industry": "Chemicals & Plastics Manufacturing", "size": {"description": "51-100 employees", "__typename": "CompanySize"}, "website": null, "__typename": "Overview"}, "reviewsSummary": {"overallRating": {"numberOfReviews": {"value": 7, "__typename": "NumberOfReviews"}, "value": 4.1, "__typename": "OverallRating"}, "__typename": "ReviewsSummary"}, "perksAndBenefits": [{"title": "Medical", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}, {"title": "Miscellaneous allowance", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}, {"title": "Vision", "__typename": "PerkAndBenefit"}], "__typename": "CompanyProfile"}, "companySearchUrl": "https://id.jobstreet.com/id/Danatel-Pratama-jobs/at-this-company", "companyTags": [], "__typename": "JobDetails"}}

